  "body": "If I put some pendrives, some are correctly recognized by webusb api..\r\nThis an SMI based pendrive example.\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/855176/53796207-53eadf80-3f3c-11e9-9403-5819a62e1651.png)\r\n\r\nIf I insert a \"SanDisk  Ultra Fit\" pendrive, it does not show up in the authorization(pairing) request.\r\nI tried many different ones.\r\nAnother working example:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/855176/53796422-cf4c9100-3f3c-11e9-9652-3ad026a5fc51.png)\r\nAnd another:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/855176/53796494-f73bf480-3f3c-11e9-8ca5-9684769de2cd.png)\r\n\r\nBut with the \"SanDisk  Ultra Fit\" there is no way.\r\nSame laptop, same OS (Linux) and same usb(3) port.\r\nOne difference though: the \"SanDisk  Ultra Fit\" is USB 3.0 while the others were all USB 2\r\n\r\nPlease fix this.\r\nP.S.\r\nThe SanDisk Ultra Fit pendrive has these IDs:\r\nidVendor=0781, idProduct=5583, bcdDevice= 1.00\r\n",
